// InternRun: UK Finance internship tracker, sourced from The Trackr
// (https://app.the-trackr.com/uk-finance/summer-internships) on 2026-08-25.
//
// This is a large, separate dataset from the pan-European CURATED list in api/listings.js —
// 400+ UK finance/banking/consulting/trading programmes, mostly London-based, spanning summer
// analyst programmes, spring insight weeks, and off-cycle internships. Kept on its own endpoint
// and page (uk-finance.html) rather than folded into the main category grid, since blending it in
// would make 'Finance' ~90% of all listings and drown out the EU/tech/NGO/platform categories.
//
// Fields:
//  - sector: one of SECTOR_ORDER below (Bulge Bracket, Elite Boutique, Middle Market, Buy-Side,
//    Asset Management, Big 4, Consulting, Trading and Quant, Real Estate, Pensions and Insurance,
//    Accounting and Audit, Miscellaneous) — mirrors The Trackr's own groupings.
//  - url: direct link to the company's application page where The Trackr exposed one; otherwise
//    falls back to the Trackr tracker page itself (many direct links are gated behind their site).
//  - rolling: true/false/null — whether the programme has a fixed deadline or accepts on a rolling
//    basis (null = not stated).
//  - sponsorsVisa: true/false/null — whether the employer sponsors a UK work visa (null = not
//    stated on the tracker).
//
// Not live-refreshed (The Trackr requires a browser session to scrape) — refresh by hand
// periodically the same way the CURATED list in api/listings.js is maintained.
